# Unit07
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2024红宝书考研英语词汇
# 描述: 基础词Unit07核心词汇

butter/ˈbʌtər/黄油/She spread butter on the toast.
button/ˈbʌtn/按钮；纽扣/Press the button to start the machine.
buy/baɪ/购买/I need to buy some groceries.
cabin/ˈkæbɪn/小屋；机舱/They stayed in a cabin in the mountains.
cable/ˈkeɪbl/电缆；电报/The cable TV has over 100 channels.
calculate/ˈkælkjuleɪt/计算/Can you calculate the total cost?
calendar/ˈkælɪndər/日历/Mark the date on the calendar.
call/kɔːl/打电话；呼叫/I'll call you when I arrive.
calm/kɑːm/平静的；镇定的/She remained calm during the emergency.
camera/ˈkæmərə/照相机/He bought a new digital camera.
camp/kæmp/营地；露营/We set up camp by the lake.
campaign/kæmˈpeɪn/运动；战役/The advertising campaign was very successful.
campus/ˈkæmpəs/校园/The university campus is very beautiful.
cancel/ˈkænsl/取消/They cancelled the meeting due to the storm.
cancer/ˈkænsər/癌症/Scientists are working hard to find a cure for cancer.
candidate/ˈkændɪdət/候选人/There are five candidates running for mayor.
capable/ˈkeɪpəbl/有能力的/She is capable of handling any challenge.
capacity/kəˈpæsəti/容量；能力/The stadium has a capacity of 50,000 people.
capital/ˈkæpɪtl/资本；首都/Beijing is the capital of China.
capture/ˈkæptʃər/捕获；夺取/The photographer captured a beautiful moment.
carbon/ˈkɑːrbən/碳/We need to reduce carbon emissions.
card/kɑːrd/卡片/She sent me a birthday card.
care/ker/关心；照顾/She cares deeply about the environment.
career/kəˈrɪr/职业；生涯/He has had a successful career in medicine.
careful/ˈkerfl/小心的；仔细的/Be careful when crossing the street.
cargo/ˈkɑːrɡoʊ/货物/The ship was loaded with cargo.
carry/ˈkæri/搬运；携带/She carried the heavy box upstairs.
case/keɪs/案例；情况/In this case, we need to take immediate action.
cash/kæʃ/现金/I don't have enough cash with me.
cast/kæst/投；铸造/She cast a glance at the clock on the wall.
casual/ˈkæʒuəl/随意的；非正式的/He wore casual clothes to the party.
cat/kæt/猫/The cat is sleeping on the sofa.
catalog/ˈkætəlɔːɡ/目录/You can find the book in the library catalog.
catch/kætʃ/接住；抓住/I threw the ball and he caught it.
category/ˈkætəɡɔːri/类别；种类/These books fall into different categories.
cattle/ˈkætl/牛；牲畜/The farmer raises cattle on his ranch.
cause/kɔːz/原因；导致/What was the cause of the accident?
caution/ˈkɔːʃn/谨慎；警告/Proceed with caution on the icy road.
cease/siːs/停止；终止/The factory ceased production last month.
celebrate/ˈselɪbreɪt/庆祝/We celebrated her birthday with a big party.
cell/sel/细胞；牢房/The human body is made up of billions of cells.
center/ˈsentər/中心/The shopping center is very crowded on weekends.
central/ˈsentrəl/中心的；主要的/Location is a central factor in buying a house.
century/ˈsentʃəri/世纪/Many great changes happened in the 20th century.
ceremony/ˈserəmoʊni/典礼；仪式/The opening ceremony was very impressive.
certain/ˈsɜːrtn/确定的；某些/I'm certain that he will come.
certificate/sərˈtɪfɪkət/证书/She received a certificate of completion.
chain/tʃeɪn/链条；连锁/He wore a gold chain around his neck.
chair/tʃer/椅子/Please take a seat in the chair.
chairman/ˈtʃermən/主席/He was elected chairman of the committee.
